# Organization API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /orgs/{org}` — Get organization profile
- `GET /orgs/{org}/members` — List members
- `GET /orgs/{org}/repos` — List org repos

## Test Data
- Primary fixture: `github` (id: 9919)
- Additional orgs: google, microsoft, facebook
